<title>USA: Echo Bay Mines Ltd Q4 earning summary.</title>
<headline>Echo Bay Mines Ltd Q4 earning summary.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.74     loss	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net loss		 103,528     loss	 5,178</p>
<p> Revs			79,544		   92,430</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 139,352		  125,536</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.31     loss	 $0.43</p>
<p> Net loss		 176,702     loss	50,060</p>
<p> Revs		     337,316		  360,730</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 134,434		  116,514</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q4 results for 1996 include one-time $77.1 million charge related to writing off Echo's Alaska-Juneau property. Full-year 1996 results included charges totaling $107.1 million. Excluding the charges, the year's net loss was $69.6 million, or $0.52 per share.</p>
